    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-2e8e0f3e-6a28-46b8-872e-578fff5311e2",
        "text": "<p>Chitrakatha, now a storytelling festival started off as an Animation festival at National Institute of Design, Ahmedabad. This festival is a platform to celebrate the creative endeavours of students and designers from across the globe. In 2019, it was for the for the first time that this festival took place at National Institute of Design, Andhra Pradesh, for its 7th edition.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
