    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-82de7f58-8da4-4e1a-a9a3-732effbf3443",
        "text": "<p>A goodie bag:</p><ol><li><p>Is a container used to carry around collectables and other small personal belongings in a festival.</p></li><li><p>Is a take away/ souvenir from the event.</p></li><li><p>Is a part of a festival merchandise; Forms a mean of event branding and advertisement.</p></li><li><p>Should be durable enough to be later used as a bag.</p></li></ol>",
