    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-52ff0743-47f8-44da-a5fd-7be31dfeb5f4",
        "text": "<p>The Bag is inspired from the \"potli\" bags used in India since ages. This Goodie bag was made out of an origami pattern. It needs 4 stitch lines to make the basic structure of the bag, and thus cuts down on the production time. The cost of an individual bag was Rs. 135.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
