    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-8947c43e-936e-464e-979d-ca811771eab8",
        "text": "<p>The Print on the bag is made out of combing three local crafts of the state. The Illustration style of the print is taken from the Leather puppet craft - Tholu Bommalata. Block making craft was then used to make the kalamkaari blocks of the print. The bag was printed in Indigo by the Kalamkaari block printing artisans.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
