      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "id": "Text-f3006eed-441c-4799-bc3f-42c45d6f86c1",
        "text": "<p>This mythological story hints at the Climate change issue, and talks about the rising sea level. It is story of a conflict between the River Goddess Krishnaveni and Goddess Kanak Durga who resides on the mountain top. Kanak Durga took Krishnaveni's nose ring in order to let her flow into the land of Vijayawada. After this incident when Durga did not return the nose ring back, Krishnaveni promised that one day, she will rise up to the mountain top and take her ring back. Furious Durga cursed that the day this happens, it will be the end of the city.</p>",
        "style": "body",
        "align": "start",
        "measure": "normal",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "s",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
        "id": "Heading-d9da9b00-937e-4c8c-a3f0-641462fd982b",
        "text": "Character development",
        "size": "title",
        "level": "h2",
        "align": "start",
        "layout": {
          "width": "text",
          "space": "m",
          "show": "all",
          "motion": "none"
        }
      }
